      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open ATAK's settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>≡</strong> and scroll the tools to the end. Tap <strong>Settings</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/aa393c30ad6dce4c.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open Tool Preferences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Tool Preferences</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dd0a91a79210f126.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the plugins' settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Specific Tool Preferences</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/af7a0168fbddd357.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find OpenDefence Main",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Scroll down and tap <strong>OD Main Preferences</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/03461b616c1cda5b.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Settings for this phone and the operation",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a row under <strong>THIS PHONE</strong> to change it, as in OpenDefence Main's menu. <strong>OPERATION</strong> shows the operation's settings, such as <strong>Quotas and corridors</strong> from UAVOps, which only admins change in OpenDefence Main.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/66e78a05025c5022.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Change your unit",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>My unit</strong> to see every unit of your ORBAT. The list opens at your unit, and <strong>No unit</strong> at its very top clears it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/e6400c97cc5e7c4c.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
